WEBVTT

00:00:10.340 --> 00:00:15.360
"I can't overcome it"  "I'm annoyed"

00:00:16.010 --> 00:00:20.100
Even if I break down those hurdles

00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:28.310
No answer emerges

00:00:28.310 --> 00:00:34.810
Am I being controlled?  Everyone on the field

00:00:34.810 --> 00:00:39.750
Isn't scared, go away, but...

00:00:39.750 --> 00:00:43.450
The unseen road to the future

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:51.200
Cannot be chosen

00:00:51.550 --> 00:00:54.500
Close your eyes and cut with your heart

00:00:54.500 --> 00:00:58.160
just like cards, surely

00:00:58.160 --> 00:01:03.230
It was promised  yes!  you are the winner

00:01:03.230 --> 00:01:06.100
never lose!  Cut with your heart

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:09.330
just like cards, surely

00:01:09.330 --> 00:01:16.680
Because a miracle will occur

00:01:22.600 --> 00:01:23.730
Yugi!

00:01:24.400 --> 00:01:27.170
Don't worry.  He's fine.

00:01:34.900 --> 00:01:44.350
I thought the other Yugi was his alter ego, and the Millennium Puzzle triggered him to appear.

00:01:45.540 --> 00:01:48.740
That's what I believed and hoped.

00:01:49.080 --> 00:01:50.170
But...

00:01:51.080 --> 00:01:57.540
Is the other Yugi a completely different person who lives inside the Puzzle?

00:01:58.370 --> 00:02:04.370
Pharaoh's Lost Memories

00:02:17.850 --> 00:02:23.050
On behalf of the Ministry Of Foreign Affairs, welcome to Japan.

00:02:23.050 --> 00:02:25.080
Thank you for coming to meet us.

00:02:25.300 --> 00:02:30.520
It's my pleasure to meet the famous director of the Egypt Archaeological Society.

00:02:31.720 --> 00:02:36.970
You've spared no effort for the ancient Egypt exhibition.

00:02:37.240 --> 00:02:42.910
We must end the history of war at all costs.

00:02:43.800 --> 00:02:49.160
I apologize.  It's a joke that's popular around Kul Elna in Egypt.

00:02:49.400 --> 00:02:54.400
I also wish for the success of the ancient Egypt exhibition.

00:03:16.400 --> 00:03:17.880
Yugi!

00:03:19.330 --> 00:03:21.750
Yugi, wait a minute!

00:03:24.710 --> 00:03:26.130
Yugi...

00:03:26.350 --> 00:03:34.660
This is Ishizu Ishtar.  She came all the way from Egypt for the ancient Egypt exhibition.

00:03:35.020 --> 00:03:37.030
Hello, people of Japan.

00:03:37.480 --> 00:03:44.570
Ms. Ishtar is the Egypt Archaeological Society's chief executive and an expert in Egyptian studies.

00:03:45.770 --> 00:03:51.080
I am honored to hold the ancient Egypt exhibition in Japan's Domino City.

00:03:51.370 --> 00:03:54.300
What's the centerpiece of this exhibition?

00:03:54.510 --> 00:04:04.260
We brought pieces of a mural discovered in a Pharaoh's temple from Egypt's 18th dynasty.

00:04:05.660 --> 00:04:09.760
This is the first time that the mural will be displayed overseas.

00:04:10.060 --> 00:04:12.100
Brother, it's incredible!

00:04:12.100 --> 00:04:14.000
First time in the world!

00:04:14.000 --> 00:04:17.000
Lame.  I'm not interested in archaeology.

00:04:17.620 --> 00:04:21.770
Really?  I think it's pretty interesting.

00:04:25.280 --> 00:04:26.120
What is it?

00:04:26.120 --> 00:04:30.380
Ishizu Ishtar, chief of the Egypt Archaeological Society, is calling you.

00:04:30.680 --> 00:04:32.180
Ishizu Ishtar?

00:04:33.200 --> 00:04:37.440
This mural will be exhibited for the first and last time.

00:04:37.440 --> 00:04:40.860
Everyone, please come see this exhibit.

00:04:51.540 --> 00:04:53.670
Wait here.  I'm going alone.

00:05:05.770 --> 00:05:09.420
Welcome.  It's my pleasure to meet you, Mr. Kaiba.

00:05:09.420 --> 00:05:15.860
I am well aware of Kaiba Corporation's dramatic growth in the hi-tech gaming industry.

00:05:16.450 --> 00:05:18.700
Chief, I found no problems.

00:05:18.710 --> 00:05:21.000
And nothing suspicious on my side.

00:05:21.660 --> 00:05:25.680
"The more polite they are, the more cautious they are."

00:05:26.020 --> 00:05:29.310
If you don't trust me, I'm leaving.

00:05:29.710 --> 00:05:30.930
My apologies.

00:05:30.930 --> 00:05:34.200
But you must understand our situation.

00:05:34.200 --> 00:05:40.970
The Egypt Archaeological Society are currently employing a desperate strategy.

00:05:40.970 --> 00:05:42.250
Strategy?

00:05:43.220 --> 00:05:45.120
You seem to have a problem.

00:05:45.250 --> 00:05:46.370
This way.

00:05:49.660 --> 00:06:01.570
The Egypt Archaeological Society was founded in 1857 to protect our historic treasures from grave robbers.

00:06:01.700 --> 00:06:06.270
We now monitor excavations around the world.

00:06:07.470 --> 00:06:11.580
If you want an expert on finding mummies, talk to someone else.

00:06:11.800 --> 00:06:16.390
I'm into cutting-edge technology and high-performance computer chips.

00:06:16.680 --> 00:06:20.450
But I'm not into stone chips that are thousands of years old.

00:06:22.050 --> 00:06:24.230
This is what you told me on the phone:

00:06:24.620 --> 00:06:29.450
Are you interested in an extremely rare card, Mr. Kaiba?

00:06:30.570 --> 00:06:34.340
I'm only interested in your rare card.

00:06:34.770 --> 00:06:37.370
Let's make the deal.

00:06:37.540 --> 00:06:38.880
Let me tell you something.

00:06:39.400 --> 00:06:42.950
I know you're very interested in Duel Monsters.

00:06:43.240 --> 00:06:47.650
What if I told you that its origin started in ancient Egypt?

00:06:47.650 --> 00:06:48.480
What?

00:06:48.480 --> 00:06:55.520
As you know, Pegasus J. Crawford is the designer who created Duel Monsters.

00:06:56.260 --> 00:06:57.630
Pegasus...

00:06:58.060 --> 00:06:59.230
Yes.

00:06:59.230 --> 00:07:05.880
What if I told you that he created Duel Monsters after visiting Egypt?

00:07:06.270 --> 00:07:09.680
This fact is not widely known.

00:07:12.570 --> 00:07:15.650
The basement has a special exhibition room.

00:07:41.000 --> 00:07:42.200
Thank you.

00:07:42.900 --> 00:07:47.440
You risked your life to assemble the Millennium Puzzle during the fire.

00:07:47.720 --> 00:07:51.780
It was Jonouchi and Honda who saved us.

00:07:52.240 --> 00:07:53.560
You're right.

00:07:53.960 --> 00:07:56.280
We have great friends.

00:07:56.600 --> 00:07:57.150
Yes.

00:07:57.480 --> 00:08:00.090
What are you thinking about?

00:08:19.860 --> 00:08:21.120
Yugi!

00:08:21.840 --> 00:08:23.760
Where are you going, Yugi?

00:08:25.080 --> 00:08:26.280
Yugi!

00:08:26.640 --> 00:08:28.400
Don't go, Yugi!

00:08:28.400 --> 00:08:29.540
Yugi!

00:08:38.340 --> 00:08:41.700
I will show you two murals.

00:08:42.170 --> 00:08:48.700
The centerpiece of the exhibition, these murals are from the 18th dynasty's Pharaoh's temple.

00:08:49.080 --> 00:08:51.870
Witness the origin of Duel Monsters.

00:09:01.060 --> 00:09:02.750
What?

00:09:05.760 --> 00:09:08.560
They're Duel Monsters!

00:09:08.560 --> 00:09:09.730
Correct.

00:09:10.660 --> 00:09:15.300
Pegasus created Duel Monsters based on this mural.

00:09:15.680 --> 00:09:20.400
There's a theory that humans and monsters used to live together.

00:09:21.100 --> 00:09:29.470
Ancient Egyptians believed that monsters caused all disasters, wars and suffering.

00:09:29.680 --> 00:09:40.130
The Pharaoh's magicians sealed them in stone tablets to stop the disasters and bring peace.

00:09:41.040 --> 00:09:46.630
But the tablets containing the monsters gradually gained evil power.

00:09:46.750 --> 00:09:51.280
Priests who disobeyed the Pharaoh manipulated the magicians.

00:09:51.280 --> 00:09:56.410
They used the evil power in the tablets to start fighting.

00:09:58.020 --> 00:10:00.320
Take a look at this other mural.

00:10:00.880 --> 00:10:03.600
This is what I wanted to show you.

00:10:04.330 --> 00:10:07.710
Please look at this mural with your own eyes.

00:10:08.020 --> 00:10:10.750
Just like Mr. Pegasus did.

00:10:11.460 --> 00:10:17.500
I'm sure that you'll be inspired, just like him.

00:10:21.340 --> 00:10:22.320
That's...

00:10:22.860 --> 00:10:23.820
Yugi!

00:10:24.660 --> 00:10:28.240
And above him is Dark Magician!

00:10:28.780 --> 00:10:33.340
There's a young priest fighting the Pharaoh.

00:10:33.770 --> 00:10:39.280
Above him is clearly Blue-Eyes White Dragon.

00:10:54.670 --> 00:11:00.660
The young Pharaoh controls a dark spellcaster, and a priest with a white beast confronts him.

00:11:01.450 --> 00:11:06.200
This mural depicts an ancient battle between duelists.

00:11:08.200 --> 00:11:14.440
The Millennium Puzzle and six other Items are above the Pharaoh and the priest.

00:11:14.650 --> 00:11:20.650
Legend says that when these seven Items are gathered, unimaginable power will appear.

00:11:20.650 --> 00:11:23.850
But this mystery is yet to be solved.

00:11:24.140 --> 00:11:30.400
But what's currently important is this depiction of the fight between the Pharaoh and the priest.

00:11:30.400 --> 00:11:34.050
And this fight is now happening again.

00:11:34.050 --> 00:11:35.650
I don't believe it.

00:11:36.260 --> 00:11:39.970
I don't believe this mural!

00:11:41.140 --> 00:11:47.450
Mr. Kaiba, no matter how hard you deny it, it is a historical fact.

00:11:47.460 --> 00:11:51.390
Open your heart to the past.

00:11:52.370 --> 00:11:53.320
Nonsense!

00:11:58.650 --> 00:11:59.470
Now!

00:12:10.930 --> 00:12:12.370
Where am I?

00:12:12.580 --> 00:12:19.050
In the name of the great sun god Ra, I hereby summon my servant!

00:12:28.680 --> 00:12:33.120
Divine punishment for the evil priest who tries to destroy our nation!

00:12:43.450 --> 00:12:47.720
God, unleash your divine punishment!

00:12:55.910 --> 00:12:58.530
What is this?

00:12:58.530 --> 00:13:03.660
You're seeing a vision of a duel from 3,000 years ago.

00:13:05.960 --> 00:13:08.560
Who are you really?

00:13:08.760 --> 00:13:10.400
I want to know.

00:13:10.700 --> 00:13:11.760
Why?

00:13:12.230 --> 00:13:13.830
Why?

00:13:14.230 --> 00:13:15.340
Because...

00:13:17.400 --> 00:13:19.000
I don't know anything.

00:13:19.000 --> 00:13:19.830
Huh?

00:13:20.130 --> 00:13:22.880
I knew you would ask me eventually.

00:13:23.650 --> 00:13:26.770
And I planned to answer honestly.

00:13:27.970 --> 00:13:32.850
I don't know my name or where I came from.

00:13:34.100 --> 00:13:37.280
I don't have any memories.

00:13:37.710 --> 00:13:40.560
I don't know who I am.

00:13:44.310 --> 00:13:51.570
Egypt has continuously supported the dynasty for 3,000 years.

00:13:52.180 --> 00:13:58.130
Inscribed here is the Pharaoh of the 18th dynasty.

00:13:58.130 --> 00:13:58.950
Pharaoh?

00:13:58.950 --> 00:14:03.960
But someone has scratched his name off.

00:14:03.960 --> 00:14:08.200
His name is also missing from his tomb and temple.

00:14:16.330 --> 00:14:23.200
I'll use great magic to fuse the new servant that God summoned with my flying servant!

00:14:26.660 --> 00:14:29.960
Come out, the one who exorcises evil!

00:14:35.780 --> 00:14:39.930
God, unleash your divine punishment!

00:14:49.460 --> 00:14:56.700
Only this Pharaoh has been erased from ancient Egyptian history.

00:14:56.930 --> 00:14:59.700
The nameless Pharaoh from 3,000 years ago.

00:15:01.160 --> 00:15:03.630
Enough of your nonsense!

00:15:04.060 --> 00:15:05.960
This is unscientific!

00:15:05.960 --> 00:15:09.520
Then watch what happens next in the vision.

00:15:09.520 --> 00:15:10.050
What?

00:15:16.120 --> 00:15:19.770
I ask in the name of the sun god Ra!

00:15:19.770 --> 00:15:22.260
Who should rule the world?

00:15:22.260 --> 00:15:24.660
The Pharaoh or me?

00:15:25.680 --> 00:15:28.640
Who deserves to be the king?

00:15:28.640 --> 00:15:32.890
With this offering to our god, I ask for an answer!

00:15:37.710 --> 00:15:40.350
God, hear me!

00:15:40.350 --> 00:15:44.560
Take these sacrifices and appear before me!

00:15:53.160 --> 00:15:56.730
I summon the white servant with blue eyes!

00:15:57.100 --> 00:15:59.030
Blue-Eyes White Dragon!

00:16:00.400 --> 00:16:02.520
I've now become the true ruler!

00:16:02.520 --> 00:16:05.040
God, give me power!

00:16:20.130 --> 00:16:22.750
I am a god!

00:16:29.760 --> 00:16:38.210
I believe that the souls of the Pharaoh and the priest in this mural are destined to meet again.

00:16:38.880 --> 00:16:41.640
Even after 3,000 years.

00:16:45.230 --> 00:16:46.380
Nonsense!

00:16:46.380 --> 00:16:48.380
This is a fake!

00:16:48.700 --> 00:16:50.180
I've wasted my time.

00:16:52.700 --> 00:16:56.330
Then let's talk about something realistic.

00:16:57.760 --> 00:17:02.040
We talked on the phone about some unique rare cards.

00:17:02.400 --> 00:17:05.920
What if I told you that Pegasus created them?

00:17:06.040 --> 00:17:07.130
What?

00:17:07.780 --> 00:17:13.010
Look at the three cards drawn at the top of the mural.

00:17:13.560 --> 00:17:15.440
Obelisk the Tormentor.

00:17:15.920 --> 00:17:17.880
Slifer the Sky Dragon.

00:17:18.370 --> 00:17:20.120
The Winged Dragon of Ra.

00:17:20.520 --> 00:17:22.420
Three God Monsters.

00:17:22.420 --> 00:17:26.510
Archaeologists call them God Cards.

00:17:26.510 --> 00:17:27.730
God Cards?

00:17:27.860 --> 00:17:33.420
Pegasus created three rare cards based on these carvings.

00:17:33.420 --> 00:17:36.630
You must have heard of them.

00:17:37.020 --> 00:17:44.910
Whoever acquires all three rare cards will reign at the top of all duelists with an undefeated legend.

00:17:44.910 --> 00:17:48.010
He will be the King of Kings.

00:17:48.310 --> 00:17:50.260
Yes, I heard about that.

00:17:50.560 --> 00:17:56.560
Depending on the user, the God Cards can be good or evil.

00:17:56.700 --> 00:18:02.890
They're forbidden cards because if misused, it can take your opponent's life.

00:18:03.300 --> 00:18:05.820
They're the ultimate weapons.

00:18:05.970 --> 00:18:10.440
Yes.  Even Pegasus was afraid of these cards.

00:18:12.720 --> 00:18:19.740
Upon his request, the Egypt Archaeological Society sealed them away in the Valley of the Kings.

00:18:20.080 --> 00:18:24.520
But someone stole them.

00:18:29.970 --> 00:18:31.120
Who?

00:18:31.780 --> 00:18:32.820
The Ghouls.

00:18:33.200 --> 00:18:34.340
Ghouls?

00:18:34.680 --> 00:18:38.280
They secretly hunt rare cards around the world.

00:18:40.920 --> 00:18:45.120
They're a group of thieves who smuggle stolen rare cards for profit.

00:18:45.220 --> 00:18:49.870
They're now rumored to be making rare cards illegally.

00:18:50.850 --> 00:18:53.220
But no one knows their identity.

00:18:53.220 --> 00:18:57.540
I want you to retrieve the God Cards before the worst happens.

00:18:58.510 --> 00:19:05.680
We're holding the Egypt exhibition in this city to display the mural showing the origin of these cards.

00:19:06.000 --> 00:19:10.710
I believe these images have the power to bring duelists here.

00:19:10.710 --> 00:19:14.080
So this city will be the scene for Duel Monsters.

00:19:14.080 --> 00:19:19.570
I see.  The Ghouls will definitely strike at a large group of duelists.

00:19:20.170 --> 00:19:22.730
And my Blue-Eyes.

00:19:24.850 --> 00:19:27.970
And this card.

00:19:28.940 --> 00:19:29.640
This is...

00:19:30.730 --> 00:19:32.740
Obelisk the Tormentor!

00:19:33.020 --> 00:19:36.480
The other two cards were stolen.

00:19:36.480 --> 00:19:41.190
In order to get them back, I entrust Obelisk the Tormentor to you.

00:19:41.700 --> 00:19:44.190
You want me to use this card to lure them?

00:19:44.510 --> 00:19:47.340
Are you sure you want to trust me that much?

00:19:47.340 --> 00:19:51.910
What if I get the rare cards back but won't give them to you?

00:19:54.000 --> 00:19:55.570
I trust you.

00:19:59.160 --> 00:20:00.240
Mr. Kaiba.

00:20:01.210 --> 00:20:02.050
What?

00:20:02.620 --> 00:20:08.640
We want to end this fight that has lasted for 3,000 years at any cost!

00:20:10.080 --> 00:20:13.180
I'll take on the Ghouls.

00:20:13.660 --> 00:20:15.520
But I have one condition.

00:20:15.740 --> 00:20:16.880
What is it?

00:20:17.340 --> 00:20:22.280
Never speak to me again about Pharaohs and priests and other occult nonsense.

00:20:22.280 --> 00:20:25.510
I have no interest in the past.

00:20:28.630 --> 00:20:29.620
Sorry.

00:20:29.940 --> 00:20:36.070
I should've never brought it up, so let's not talk about it again.

00:20:36.670 --> 00:20:44.800
The one thing I know is that I only exist because you hold the Millennium Puzzle.

00:20:44.800 --> 00:20:46.150
That's enough.

00:20:46.150 --> 00:20:46.920
But I-

00:20:46.920 --> 00:20:48.090
I said enough!

00:20:52.540 --> 00:20:55.460
I want to stay with you forever.

00:20:56.880 --> 00:21:00.240
I don't care if I never get my memories back.

00:21:00.240 --> 00:21:02.830
I also want to be with you forever.

00:21:02.830 --> 00:21:07.370
I'm willing to give you all my memories.

00:21:22.220 --> 00:21:25.680
The God Card Obelisk the Tormentor.

00:21:37.330 --> 00:21:41.340
This is what the millions of Anzu fans have been waiting for!

00:21:41.340 --> 00:21:46.740
Anzu Mazaki takes center stage in a dance battle at the game center in the next episode!

00:21:46.920 --> 00:21:50.640
I defeat the playboy Step Johnny with my beautiful dance moves!

00:21:50.880 --> 00:21:53.840
What?  You want to duel?

00:21:53.840 --> 00:21:59.020
Yugi wants to handle it?  He always takes the best parts!

00:21:59.390 --> 00:22:01.860
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Flaming Dance Battle

00:22:01.980 --> 00:22:03.400
Duel, standby!

00:22:17.290 --> 00:22:21.790
Even a long, long time ago

00:22:22.590 --> 00:22:27.160
I feel like I've been here

00:22:27.700 --> 00:22:36.840
The setting sun colors the classroom after school

00:22:37.140 --> 00:22:48.350
We all laugh as you point out that I cut my bangs too short

00:22:51.220 --> 00:22:55.860
Time passes bit by bit

00:22:56.530 --> 00:23:01.130
The time when my bangs touch my eyelids

00:23:01.700 --> 00:23:06.240
Will never change

00:23:06.900 --> 00:23:11.510
The sunset envelops everyone

00:23:12.140 --> 00:23:16.710
To be who I am

00:23:17.310 --> 00:23:21.950
I've kept searching for something

00:23:22.620 --> 00:23:26.660
The time that we're now spending together

00:23:26.660 --> 00:23:29.590
I learned that's the answer

00:23:30.390 --> 00:23:36.700
From now until forever...
